WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.055
The four jobs of a manager. Being a manager is not a title; it is four jobs you do every week.

2
00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:12.874
Job one: get the work done. Job two: take care of your people.

3
00:00:12.924 --> 00:00:19.480
Job three: make things better. Job four: connect your team to the rest of Vanderbilt.

4
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:25.231
Every manager does all four, and most weeks need one more than the others.

5
00:00:25.281 --> 00:00:31.914
Part of the job is noticing which. Tap each card on the page to see the habits inside.

